# API

`apps/graphql/src/graphql/**/*.graphql` is the only declaration of a note. Server codegen writes `Resolvers` into `apps/graphql/src/generated/graphql.ts`. Client operations live in `packages/api/src/operations`, and `packages/api` codegen writes the hooks.

Do not hand-write resolver argument types. Resolvers call modules. Modules take a `NotesStore`, not a Prisma client.

Run `bun run codegen` after a schema change and commit the result. CI fails when codegen leaves a diff.

Integration tests call `executeGraphqlRequest` with a fake store. Cover the list query and the blank-title error.
